# U31: the Spectre Library popup (build:OpenSpectreLibrary, U20; the stand-in "Spectres"
# button) of allflame_exp_048: MinionSearchListControl (the source) and MinionListControl
# (the destination). Hover a source row (AddValueTooltip); type "shaman" in the search field
# (ListFilterChanged: the filtered list, SelectIndex 1); Add; double-click source row 2
# (OnSelClick: AddSel); mode "Skills" in the dropdown and "fire" (filter by skill names);
# drag source row 1 onto the destination (CanReceiveDrag/ReceiveDrag at selDragIndex);
# clear the search (the unfiltered list); select destination row 1 and Remove (OnSelDelete);
# Save (spectreList, modFlag, buildFlag). The popup is centred: own screen per script.
#! u31-expect Spectres in Build:
#! u31-expect Available Spectres:
#! u31-expect Life Multiplier:
#! u31-expect Alpine Shaman
#! u31-expect spectres: 2
screen 1920 1080 dpi 1.5
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_048.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 2
key-up CTRL
